      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "AC Electrical was recommended by Solarquotes. I found Aaron very good to deal with, supplied a very detailed and competitive quote.For our usage profile, very low, we decided on a 3kw system. This system in quote gave a payback period of 3.5 years.The installation was clean and efficient, including an upgrade of switchboard. The installers were very professional and friendly. All install requirements to grid carried out very efficiently, making the process enjoyable.The initial out showed a rapid oscillating, which was reported to Aaron,  who contacted Goodwe support, who carried an online update to tune to grid. Output is now steady.After 10days in autumn we appear on track to achieve payback in 2.5 years. I was skeptical solar would be economic for our usage, but at this stage appears I have been proved wrong.I recommend AC Electrical",
